[39;49m[K[2m• [22mA terminal emulator is a program that gives you a text-based window for[39m[49m[0m
[39;49m[K  interacting with your computer. It lets you type commands, run programs,[39m[49m[0m
[39;49m[K  inspect files, and manage processes using a shell. The emulator displays the[39m[49m[0m
[39;49m[K  output from those commands and sends your keystrokes back to the running[39m[49m[0m
[39;49m[K  session. It also handles details like colors, cursor movement, scrolling, copy[39m[49m[0m
[39;49m[K  and paste, and keyboard shortcuts. Modern terminal emulators can open multiple[39m[49m[0m
[39;49m[K  tabs or panes, save settings, and connect to remote machines over tools like[39m[49m[0m
[39;49m[K  SSH. In short, it provides the familiar command-line workspace inside a[39m[49m[0m
[39;49m[K  graphical operating system.[39m[49m[0m[r[20;3H[20;2H[0m[49m[K[21;2H[0m[49m[K[22;22H[0m[49m[K[23;2H[0m[49m[K[22;1H[1m›[22;3H[22m[2m[2mImplement {feature}[24;3H[22m[38;2;246;226;183;49mgpt-5.5 default[2m[39;49m · [22m[38;2;171;223;167;49m/private/var/folders/_3/xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx/T/ag…[39m[49m[0m[0 q[?25h[22;3H[?2026l[?2026h[20;2H[0m[49m[K[21;2H[0m[49m[K[22;22H[0m[49m[K[23;2H[0m[49m[K[39m[49m[0m[0 q[?25h[22;3H[?2026l]0;agent-bridge-record-1...[?2026h[20;2H[0m[49m[K[21;2H[0m[49m[K[22;22H[0m[49m[K[23;2H[0m[49m[K[39m[49m[0m[0 q[?25h[22;3H[?2026l[?2026h[20;2H[0m[49m[K[21;2H[0m[49m[K[22;22H[0m[49m[K[23;2H[0m[49m[K[39m[49m[0m[0 q[?25h[22;3H[?2026l[?2026h[20;2H[0m[49m[K[21;2H[0m[49m[K[22;8H[0m[49m[K[23;2H[0m[49m[K[24;20H[0m[49m[K[22;3H/quit[24;3H[1m[38;5;6;49m/quit  exit Codex[39m[49m[0m[0 q[?25h[22;8H[?2026l[?2026h[20;1H[J[20;2H[0m[49m[K[21;2H[0m[49m[K[22;19H[0m[49m[K[23;2H[0m[49m[K[22;1H[2m›[22;3HShutting down...[39m[49m[0m[?25l[?2026l[20;1H[J]0;[<1u[<u[>4;0m[?2004l[?1004l[0 q[?25h[0 q[?25hToken usage: total=5,271 input=5,149 (+ 9,600 cached) output=122
